
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CharZ EV Charging</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f7f6;
      color: #18312d;
    }
    header {
      background: #103b35;
      color: white;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 30px;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px #00000010;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #087f5b;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #60716d;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>⚡ CharZ EV Charging</h1>
    <p>Find EV charging closer to you.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>Find a Charging Station</h2>
      <p>Discover neighbourhood charging points for your electric vehicle.</p>
      <p>Our station directory is coming soon.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Host a Charger at Your Property</h2>
      <p>Have parking space? Partner with CharZ and explore earning from EV charging.</p>
      <a class="button"
         href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@example.com?subject=EV%20Charger%20Partnership">
        Become a Host
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Building a neighbourhood network of accessible EV charging points, one property at a time.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 CharZ EV Charging</p>
    <p>Neighbourhood charging, connected.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
